section.about-processes.section-py
    .container
        .section-wrapper
            .row.items-center

                //- ==========================================================
                //- PROCESS SLIDER
                //- ==========================================================
                .col-lg-7
                    .about-processes-swiper.swiper-column-auto.swiper-loop.allow-touchMove.relative
                        .swiper
                            .swiper-wrapper
                                -for(i=0;i<5;i++)
                                    .swiper-slide.process-slide(
                                        data-index=i
                                    )
                                        .process-slide__inner
                                            .item-img
                                                .img-wrapper
                                                    .img(class="img-ratio ratio:pt-[616_616]")
                                                        +PugImg()


                //- ==========================================================
                //- PROCESS LIST
                //- ==========================================================
                .col-lg-5
                    .processes-list

                        //- ==================================================
                        //- 01
                        //- ==================================================
                        .process-item.active(
                            data-index="0"
                        )
                            .process-item__header
                                span.process-item__icon
                                    | −

                                span.process-item__title
                                    | Premium Genetics

                            .process-item__content
                                p
                                    | A key strength of Bel Ga Asia lies in its access to world-class genetics through strategic partnerships with Aviagen and Hendrix Genetics. By utilizing internationally recognized parent stock genetics, we provide high-performance day-old chicks and day-old layers with outstanding health, uniformity, growth performance, and productivity. Supported by integrated production systems and rigorous quality control processes, our day-old chicks and day-old layers provide a strong foundation for poultry producers to achieve optimal flock performance and maximize their production potential.


                        //- ==================================================
                        //- 02
                        //- ==================================================
                        .process-item(
                            data-index="1"
                        )
                            .process-item__header
                                span.process-item__icon
                                    | +

                                span.process-item__title
                                    | State-of-the-Art Hatchery

                            .process-item__content
                                p
                                    | Content for State-of-the-Art Hatchery.


                        //- ==================================================
                        //- 03
                        //- ==================================================
                        .process-item(
                            data-index="2"
                        )
                            .process-item__header
                                span.process-item__icon
                                    | +

                                span.process-item__title
                                    | State of the Art Parent Stock Farm

                            .process-item__content
                                p
                                    | Content for State of the Art Parent Stock Farm.


                        //- ==================================================
                        //- 04
                        //- ==================================================
                        .process-item(
                            data-index="3"
                        )
                            .process-item__header
                                span.process-item__icon
                                    | +

                                span.process-item__title
                                    | Biosecurity and animal welfare

                            .process-item__content
                                p
                                    | Content for Biosecurity and animal welfare.


                        //- ==================================================
                        //- 05
                        //- ==================================================
                        .process-item(
                            data-index="4"
                        )
                            .process-item__header
                                span.process-item__icon
                                    | +

                                span.process-item__title
                                    | Innovation and Sustainability

                            .process-item__content
                                p
                                    | Content for Innovation and Sustainability.